//
//  Gathering stage 3, part "Foliage gathering": what the retail client and server say around a harvest of a painted tree or plant (tests/capture_foliage.h, generated by
//  tools/capture/gen_foliage.py from twelve harvest captures and the login of capture 1198) against the typed codecs of protocol/repl and the generated schemas of the state actor.
//
//    * ServerStartInteractionWithFoliage (the client's RPC on the PlayerController): the thirteen starts read to their last bit with the instance, owner, component and state the
//      generator's own reader found, and are written back to the exact bits (the instance index is left out when it is 0)
//    * the pawn's UPlayerInfo.FoliageData: the thirty set and clear blocks read, are typed (a set: the channel's length, the start on the synchronized clock, the instance, its owner and
//      component, the state, the tool; a clear: nothing but state 3 and the index 0xFFFFFFFF) and are written back to the exact bits
//    * the server's ClientConfirmMultiInteractFoliage (one bit), ClientInterruptInteractionWithFoliage (the instance and its names) and the movement callout of capture 1464
//    * AIntrepidStateIFA and UIntrepidFoliageStateComponent: the twelve captured opens (the actor block of a painted cell, 520 bits, and of a town's runtime foliage, 592: three of capture
//      1428 (its re-open after the Oak was cut among them), the seven cells of 1198's login, the two towns') and their components read and written back; every IndexedStates block of the captures (61 distinct) reads to its last bit with the array key, base key, deletes and items the generator found,
//      and the writer reproduces the same bits from the array and a shadow at the base key
//    * the order of capture 1463's result frame
//    * the trees that start and never finish (the retests of 2026-10-12): the client's 550-bit call on a subobject it names by path (capture_in_place.h) used to take every call of its
//      bunch away, a tree's start among them.  A start beside it, before it, behind thirteen of them: read, the call skipped by its bit count; an RPC field the class has no RPC for the same
// ============================================================================
